    "title": "Redding to honor fallen flight nurse Suzie Smith's legacy on Nov. 14 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago REDDING, Calif. — The family of fallen flight nurse Suzie Smith has announced details for her upcoming celebration of life. Suzie’s husband, RJ Smith, confirmed that the service will take place on Thursday, November 14, at the Redding Civic Auditorium. Doors will open at 5 p.m., and the service will begin at 6 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
